  "prefLabel": "Fis 604.06 Cocheco River",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 604.06 Cocheco River. The Cocheco River and its tributaries shall be closed to the taking of river herring by any method from the head-of-tide dam in Dover, downstream to the confluence of the Piscataqua River.\n\nSource. #14161, EXEMPT, eff 12-27-24",
